    "text": "David and Barbara Leeman, Hosanna in Excelsis: Hymns and Devotions for the Christmas Season (Moody, 2020), “Joy to the World.”",
    "url": "https://www.amazon.com/Hosanna-Excelsis-Devotions-Christmas-Season/dp/0802419933"
